	quests: [
		{
			dependencies: ["183EEB9BF7A06AC5"]
			description: [
				"The &6Proxima Approach Data&r says the nearest star has a rocky planet in its habitable zone. The &6Heavy Curium Oxide&r in store is what the next isotopes start from."
				"The road runs up the elevator, through a gate, to Mercury and Proxima b. The machines on that road have their own chapters."
			]
			icon: "grindless:proxima_approach_data"
			id: "7547756221DFC688"
			rewards: [{ id: "346612C938791C98", type: "xp", xp: 50 }]
			shape: "rsquare"
			size: 1.5d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "76869EAD54A7755D", item: "grindless:proxima_approach_data", type: "item" }
				{ id: "15D4A858D3559C38", item: "grindless:heavy_curium_oxide", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Proxima and Beyond"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7547756221DFC688"]
			description: ["Most of UHV is built at home: isotopes, light, silicon carbide, life. The gate and the stations need all of it, so the machines chapters come before the rockets."]
			icon: "gtceu:uhv_machine_hull"
			id: "7B1B3520DA69C5CF"
			rewards: [{ id: "53D90EEEA849ABAD", type: "xp", xp: 25 }]
			shape: "circle"
			size: 0.75d
			tasks: [{ id: "1F3499C554481644", type: "checkmark" }]
			title: "Home First"
			x: 2.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7B1B3520DA69C5CF"]
			description: ["Berkelium, californium, nickel-63 and thorium-229 all come from one very hot reactor and its chemistry. They feed the clock, the batteries and the gate."]
			icon: "gtceu:high_flux_reactor"
			id: "383F71E7F4EB2E04"
			rewards: [{ id: "3E44794CC518E9C1", type: "xp", xp: 25 }]
			shape: "circle"
			size: 0.75d
			tasks: [{ id: "7A5CE6BD3D42771F", type: "checkmark" }]
			title: "Heavier Isotopes"
			x: 4.0d
			y: -2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7B1B3520DA69C5CF"]
			description: ["Crystals, lasers and optical chips replace a lot of electronics from here on. The glass that carries them is pulled in orbit."]
			icon: "gtceu:photonic_foundry"
			id: "11110AB468E36B0D"
			rewards: [{ id: "707289F81CD31075", type: "xp", xp: 25 }]
			shape: "circle"
			size: 0.75d
			tasks: [{ id: "33359CAB99CB0CB9", type: "checkmark" }]
			title: "Light Does the Work"
			x: 4.0d
			y: 2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7B1B3520DA69C5CF"]
			description: ["The &6Space Elevator&r is a base, a cable and a lift: payload reaches the stations without a rocket. A tether climber on a ribbon long enough to reach orbit, and the elevator's own casings. Station level 8 and the kits for Mercury and Proxima b. Load the lift from ME and let it send payload on a schedule."]
			icon: "gtca:space_elevator"
			id: "35742EE8AEFA05B1"
			rewards: [{ id: "39ABAC61C7FA58B4", type: "xp", xp: 200 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "5F29C58652F067B3", item: "gtca:space_elevator", type: "item" }]
			title: "Up the Elevator"
			x: 4.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["35742EE8AEFA05B1"]
			description: ["The elevator reaches the eighth station level. UHV hulls can now go up with the payload, and the next two stations need them."]
			icon: "gtceu:uhv_machine_hull"
			id: "1F6A7661A3F34B33"
			rewards: [{ id: "12B3149ECD8C5CFE", type: "xp", xp: 50 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "1CE11D9B214A8D5F", type: "checkmark" }]
			title: "Level Eight"
			x: 6.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1F6A7661A3F34B33"]
			description: ["Nothing that lived on another world reaches Earth unsterilised. Every lab that handles samples sits behind casing rated &6BSL-4&r: it seals the room."]
			icon: "grindless:bsl4_casing"
			id: "54F8656D207407E6"
			rewards: [{ id: "5F371F91932FE974", type: "xp", xp: 100 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "3E337F8FE8E5B861", item: "grindless:bsl4_casing", type: "item" }]
			title: "Planetary Protection"
			x: 6.0d
			y: 2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1F6A7661A3F34B33"]
			description: ["An antimatter-catalysed fission motor behind a heat-proof nozzle. The &6ICAN Rocket Motor&r, built in the thruster assembly from an ICAN pellet, a UHTC nozzle, two SiC power modules and a stage, is the engine of the level 8 rocket."]
			icon: "grindless:ican_rocket_motor"
			id: "5E37EDBD4D78FD91"
			rewards: [{ id: "3B1BE6F3961BB36E", type: "xp", xp: 150 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "58331EBD0E896E96", item: "grindless:ican_rocket_motor", type: "item" }]
			title: "The Motor"
			x: 8.0d
			y: 2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5E37EDBD4D78FD91"]
			description: ["The level 8 rocket carries its fuel in the &6BNNT Fuel Tank&r: an aerogel tank wound in boron nitride and carbon nanotube yarn, light and tight enough for the trip. The cryotank winder: an aerogel fuel tank, 16 BNNT yarn, 16 carbon nanotube yarn, 4 hexagonal boron nitride dust, epoxy, the Pluto-Kuiper chart and circuit program 1. The level 8 rocket, built with the ICAN motor, which reaches Proxima b. Yarns and aerogel tanks by ME; the winder takes a long time per tank, so run several."]
			icon: "grindless:bnnt_fuel_tank"
			id: "7BBD85168C76A7BF"
			rewards: [{ id: "759C42A6A16B409F", type: "xp", xp: 150 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "303D77A5F08956F9", item: "grindless:bnnt_fuel_tank", type: "item" }]
			title: "The Long-Haul Tank"
			x: 10.0d
			y: 4.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1F6A7661A3F34B33"]
			description: [
				"The &6Warp Gate&r is a ring built at both ends: one in Earth orbit, one at Proxima b. Opening it takes four exotic matter cells, four antihydrogen cartridges, the approach data, a nuclear clock and an organoid processor; one exotic matter cell per run keeps it open. Build the gate itself in the machines chapter."
				"Antihydrogen and exotic matter come from their own lines; the empty cartridges come back after each run."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:warp_gate"
			id: "53A07A3FD419957D"
			rewards: [{ id: "13D9DC95FA10AF87", type: "xp", xp: 50 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "3CA8E59CFDDAB411", type: "checkmark" }]
			title: "The Gate Opens"
			x: 8.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["53A07A3FD419957D"]
			description: ["The Casimir force is real and tiny. Nobody has made negative energy from it. Here it holds a gate open, and that is a story the pack tells, not physics."]
			icon: "gtceu:casimir_array"
			id: "500C6DF0C20661A1"
			rewards: [{ id: "52D5B823F117A11B", type: "xp", xp: 25 }]
			shape: "circle"
			size: 0.75d
			tasks: [{ id: "3E6C008E496707B0", type: "checkmark" }]
			title: "Fiction, Mostly"
			x: 10.0d
			y: 2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["53A07A3FD419957D"]
			description: ["A holding ring carries a player standing in it to the ring named by the Relay Coordinates in its input bus. With no coordinates it sends them to the first other holding ring, as Earth and Proxima b do. Items go over the AE2 pair the &6Proxima Gate Seed&r makes, so nobody has to carry a stack of plates."]
			icon: "grindless:proxima_gate_seed"
			id: "773081F576E0FF0C"
			rewards: [{ id: "338F95708DA5F3F1", type: "xp", xp: 200 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "51FE75CDC8A3EABC", item: "grindless:proxima_gate_seed", type: "item" }]
			title: "Step Through"
			x: 10.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1F6A7661A3F34B33"]
			description: ["The seventh station orbits Mercury, close enough to the Sun that the heat tells the first mirror what it will be."]
			icon: "gtceu:uhv_machine_hull"
			id: "188AE1CE6129054A"
			rewards: [{ id: "5880D3FE9402903D", type: "xp", xp: 120 }]
			tasks: [{ dimension: "gcyr:mercury_orbit", id: "7843273068BF0C5A", type: "dimension" }]
			title: "Seventh Station"
			x: 8.0d
			y: -2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["188AE1CE6129054A"]
			description: ["Mercury gets several times the sunlight Earth does. The surface is vacuum and the day side is a furnace, so the solar vapour furnace there runs only in daylight."]
			icon: "minecraft:sunflower"
			id: "79AAE037161EDE29"
			rewards: [{ id: "1A195C9839E7A63C", type: "xp", xp: 25 }]
			shape: "circle"
			size: 0.75d
			tasks: [{ id: "12925EC584FD4ACA", type: "checkmark" }]
			title: "Under Six Suns"
			x: 10.0d
			y: -2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["79AAE037161EDE29"]
			description: ["A swarm needs aluminium, magnesium and silicon. Mercury's surface has all three and almost no gravity to climb out of. The segments are built in orbit, where the light is strongest."]
			icon: "grindless:swarm_segment"
			id: "3C4C338797034B68"
			rewards: [{ id: "33DB6A2CD2FDB548", type: "xp", xp: 25 }]
			shape: "circle"
			size: 0.75d
			tasks: [{ id: "3031851BB2967281", type: "checkmark" }]
			title: "Where the Mirrors Come From"
			x: 12.0d
			y: -2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["773081F576E0FF0C"]
			description: ["The gate lands you in orbit round Proxima b. Build the eighth station here and the rest of the system opens up."]
			icon: "gtceu:uhv_machine_hull"
			id: "19AB4881A7FF6E18"
			rewards: [{ id: "30E024812EF68CBD", type: "xp", xp: 150 }]
			tasks: [{ dimension: "grindless:proxima_b_orbit", id: "103BA7E82E1F2E3D", type: "dimension" }]
			title: "Eighth Station"
			x: 12.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["19AB4881A7FF6E18"]
			description: ["The planet is tidally locked: one face in endless red light, one in endless night. Set the base down on the lit side with the &6Proxima Base Casing&r."]
			icon: "grindless:proxima_base_casing"
			id: "5CDA3DF7F1BF99CE"
			rewards: [{ id: "3A7D651B895D34C9", type: "xp", xp: 150 }]
			tasks: [
				{ dimension: "gcyr:proxima_centauri_b", id: "33B9B9BED934A0D9", type: "dimension" }
				{ id: "5F0D2C59705112C9", item: "grindless:proxima_base_casing", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Landing on Proxima b"
			x: 14.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5CDA3DF7F1BF99CE"]
			description: ["Proxima throws UV-class flares several times a day. The base needs shielding, and the black fungi that eat radiation grow well here."]
			icon: "grindless:proxima_base_casing"
			id: "74C68F68F6A9B2ED"
			rewards: [{ id: "5A7E09FB722B22A7", type: "xp", xp: 25 }]
			shape: "circle"
			size: 0.75d
			tasks: [{ id: "1A9966AAD902A4F6", type: "checkmark" }]
			title: "Flares"
			x: 16.0d
			y: 2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5CDA3DF7F1BF99CE"]
			description: ["A rover, a drill, a greenhouse, a vat and a heap do the work down here. Life from this planet only enters Earth through the sample receiving facility."]
			icon: "gtceu:xenoflora_rover_bay"
			id: "1C3C27581EBADD27"
			rewards: [{ id: "17BAB7A9D645EF3F", type: "xp", xp: 25 }]
			shape: "circle"
			size: 0.75d
			tasks: [{ id: "521E55AA12387A0F", type: "checkmark" }]
			title: "Six Machines on the Ground"
			x: 16.0d
			y: -2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5CDA3DF7F1BF99CE"]
			description: ["Measure a star from two places and its distance falls out. The astrometer in Proxima b orbit has four light years of baseline to the telescopes at home, and it charts the neighbourhood."]
			icon: "grindless:stellar_neighbourhood_chart"
			id: "198E84EB67959EFD"
			rewards: [{ id: "537103DE9E752D20", type: "xp", xp: 200 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "5D29369F539AC42B", item: "grindless:stellar_neighbourhood_chart", type: "item" }]
			title: "Four Light Years of Baseline"
			x: 16.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["198E84EB67959EFD"]
			description: ["The &6Stellar Neighbourhood Chart&r is the research for the assembly line that builds the &6UEV Machine Casing&r; the UEV hull has its own research. Keep the gate and the swarm running: UEV asks for both."]
			icon: "gtceu:uev_machine_casing"
			id: "7C44999E6D4544D4"
			rewards: [{ id: "7A2EC01C0F46175B", type: "xp", xp: 100 }]
			shape: "diamond"
			size: 1.75d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "18D50FCA097C32A5", item: "gtceu:uev_machine_casing", type: "item" }
				{ id: "1F6A9EE257BCCA4E", item: "grindless:stellar_neighbourhood_chart", type: "item" }
				{ id: "73B2468A12CFCEC1", item: "grindless:coronal_field_map", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Gate to UEV"
			x: 18.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7B1B3520DA69C5CF"]
			description: [
				"The photonic and quantum chips of this age."
				"Wafers, lasers, memory and the four mainframes, then the hull."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:uhv_circuit_assembler"
			id: "357A03FF61BCC69C"
			rewards: [ ]
			shape: "circle"
			size: 0.75d
			tasks: [{ id: "7A95D920731195CD", type: "checkmark" }]
			title: "UHV Circuits"
			x: 5.0d
			y: 7.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5EF940CA680ECC5C"]
			description: ["The eight &6UHV Components&r (emitter, sensor, field generator, robot arm, conveyor module, pump, piston and motor) are what every UHV controller, the UHV circuit assembler and the parallel hatch are built from. Each is an assembly line recipe on top of its UV part, the motor goes into most of the others. The UV component of the same kind, neutronium, naquadria and europium cable; the emitter, sensor, field generator and arm also take UHV circuits, the mainframes made above. The UHV circuit assembler, which takes an arm, an emitter and two conveyors, and the controllers of the machines chapter. Stock each UHV component by ME: a controller draws up to five of the same kind."]
			icon: "gtceu:uhv_robot_arm"
			id: "53B449FCC14AE4EC"
			rewards: [{ id: "51EE4491697A7129", type: "xp", xp: 100 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "51AAB1C86F9BD2C6", item: "gtceu:uhv_emitter", type: "item" }
				{ id: "711BEAED4F0C4E64", item: "gtceu:uhv_sensor", type: "item" }
				{ id: "13DAE23470E09EC6", item: "gtceu:uhv_field_generator", type: "item" }
				{ id: "7F864547F212F8DD", item: "gtceu:uhv_robot_arm", type: "item" }
				{ id: "52CF7F0C8D793E2F", item: "gtceu:uhv_conveyor_module", type: "item" }
				{ id: "7B0CED2023795268", item: "gtceu:uhv_electric_pump", type: "item" }
				{ id: "358742ED4891F896", item: "gtceu:uhv_electric_piston", type: "item" }
				{ id: "1AE64EE53ED4E538", item: "gtceu:uhv_electric_motor", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "UHV Components"
			x: 20.0d
			y: 6.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5EF940CA680ECC5C"]
			description: ["The &6UHV Machine Hull&r is the frame of every UHV hatch and of the UHV circuit assembler. It is made in an assembler from two UHV machine casings, polybenzimidazole and europium cable; it takes no circuit. Two UHV machine casings, polybenzimidazole and europium cable. The UHV circuit assembler and the UHV hatches. Craft a few at a time by ME; each hatch and machine takes one."]
			icon: "gtceu:uhv_machine_hull"
			id: "5829C4310B9C88A2"
			rewards: [{ id: "1A437D0DA5EF1494", type: "xp", xp: 120 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "1FC4635048D8F695", item: "gtceu:uhv_machine_hull", type: "item" }]
			title: "The UHV Hull"
			x: 20.0d
			y: 8.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["53B449FCC14AE4EC", "5829C4310B9C88A2"]
			description: ["The &6UHV Circuit Assembler&r is the first assembler that can put together the circuits UHV machines are made of. A UHV hull, a UHV robot arm, a UHV emitter, two UHV conveyor modules, two UHV circuits (the mainframes made on this page), europium cable and the UV circuit assembler it upgrades. The circuit rows of the eras above, and every controller of this era that asks for it. Boards and chips arrive from the cleanroom by ME; keep a stock of what it returns."]
			icon: "gtceu:uhv_circuit_assembler"
			id: "1DEA3F88969A67A0"
			rewards: [{ id: "1A03282D60659D1E", type: "xp", xp: 150 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "3C832B3A67C41A44", item: "gtceu:uhv_circuit_assembler", type: "item" }]
			title: "UHV Circuit Assembler"
			x: 22.0d
			y: 8.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["357A03FF61BCC69C"]
			description: ["A &6Lithium Niobate Wafer&r is cut from a boule pulled out of a melt. It bends light with an electric field, so a chip can modulate a beam. A boule from the crystal growth furnace, and a cleanroom to cut and polish it. The LNOI wafer next to it, and through it the optical processor. The crucible is reused; keep boules and cut wafers in a stocked chest by ME."]
			icon: "grindless:lithium_niobate_wafer"
			id: "5EEE3C1532815682"
			rewards: [{ id: "302C197B378C3009", type: "xp", xp: 100 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "17482D5A20CE4003", item: "grindless:lithium_niobate_wafer", type: "item" }]
			title: "Lithium Niobate Wafer"
			x: 8.0d
			y: 5.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5EEE3C1532815682"]
			description: ["Bond a thin lithium niobate film onto silicon and you have the &6LNOI Wafer&r, the stage light is guided on. A helium implant splits the film off a lithium niobate wafer, and the photonic foundry bonds it. A lithium niobate wafer cut with a helium implant (the ion implantation recipe), a silicon wafer, quicklime, ultrapure water, oxygen and hydrofluoric acid, in the photonic foundry. The lithium niobate wafer comes back. The phase-change die and the optical processor, which takes three LNOI wafers. Keep the implanted wafers, silicon wafers and quicklime stocked by ME and the acid and water piped; stock the LNOI wafers for the foundry."]
			icon: "grindless:lnoi_wafer"
			id: "337220D20FD9CC58"
			rewards: [{ id: "1B142E48CA1A15CB", type: "xp", xp: 120 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "7E6367A82D94D859", item: "grindless:lnoi_wafer", type: "item" }]
			title: "Lithium Niobate on Insulator"
			x: 10.0d
			y: 5.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["337220D20FD9CC58"]
			description: ["A chalcogenide film flips between glass and crystal when a laser says so, and the &6Photonic Die&r keeps a bit of light in that state. The photonic foundry: one LNOI wafer and a GST target per batch, with argon and ultrapure water. Eight dies come out, and a spent target. The optical processor, which takes six. The foundry fills a stack of dies per wafer; send them on by ME and recycle the spent target."]
			icon: "grindless:pcm_photonic_die"
			id: "1EBB75CF8CF72E85"
			rewards: [{ id: "57D123494496A216", type: "xp", xp: 120 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "3446A88116833B67", item: "grindless:pcm_photonic_die", type: "item" }]
			title: "Phase-Change Die"
			x: 12.0d
			y: 5.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["337220D20FD9CC58"]
			description: ["A &6Thin-Film Lithium Niobate Modulator&r switches a beam with a voltage. One LNOI wafer is cut into sixteen of them, and the optical processor needs ten per batch. The photonic foundry: one LNOI wafer, ultrapure water and a circuit program. The optical processor. One wafer fills a stack of modulators: stock them by ME and send them to the foundry that makes processors."]
			icon: "grindless:thin_film_ln_modulator"
			id: "78442C1D1F08AEFD"
			rewards: [{ id: "7F7B45DE8CB049A8", type: "xp", xp: 120 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "52D815ADC23C5568", item: "grindless:thin_film_ln_modulator", type: "item" }]
			title: "Thin-Film Modulators"
			x: 14.0d
			y: 4.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1EBB75CF8CF72E85", "34795C9D86BC364D", "78442C1D1F08AEFD"]
			description: ["A processor that thinks in light and runs cold: the &6Optical Processor&r is the light half of the optical assembly that goes into the wetware mainframe. In the photonic foundry: three LNOI wafers, six phase-change dies, three quantum cascade lasers, ten thin-film lithium niobate modulators, ultrapure water and a circuit program. Two processors come out. The optical assembly, which takes three processors. Foundry inputs by ME; processors go into their own chest, one stack per assembly."]
			icon: "gtnn:optical_processor"
			id: "74E5CDD1317012FB"
