		{
			dependencies: ["105E4880E4ADC4FD"]
			description: ["Silicon carbide takes more heat and volts than silicon, and the &6SiC Power Module&r is what the swarm's control gear is built from. An inverted metamorphic array stacks a junction for every colour of light. The SiC device fab and the solar array fab, both from the machines chapter, and ultrapure water for the wafers. Swarm segments and the UHV power gear. Boules and wafers move by bus; keep the ultrapure water on its own pipe."]
			icon: "grindless:sic_power_module"
			id: "5777F10880908743"
			rewards: [{ id: "3A939E13B316928C", type: "xp", xp: 120 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
