			x: 18.0d
			y: -9.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["105E4880E4ADC4FD"]
			description: ["The &6UHV SMES Cell&r holds a huge store of EU and is the cell the UHV wireless network is built on. In the naquadria magnet works: four UV SMES cells, RTAN wire, neutronium plates and liquid helium. The UHV wireless tier. Nothing to feed. Size the towers for your busiest hour."]
			icon: "grindless:uhv_smes_cell"
			id: "5E6B4DEB712EECBE"
			rewards: [{ id: "3CE50DA47EC8E899", type: "xp", xp: 200 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "73DB8F65AD12D9BD", item: "gtceu:naquadria_magnet_works", type: "item" }
				{ id: "36ADD428AD14F1EB", item: "grindless:uhv_smes_cell", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "The UHV Cell"
			x: 10.0d
			y: 41.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5E6B4DEB712EECBE"]
			description: ["Move your towers onto &6UHV SMES Cells&r and the wireless network carries UHV, out to the stations and now to Mercury and Proxima. One formed tower holding a UHV cell: the network runs at its strongest cell, so until then it stays at UV. Each wireless hatch and cover takes a nuclear clock. Stations that run on power made at home, and the wireless hatches and covers at UHV. Add cells when the network dips at your busiest hour."]
			icon: "gtceu:uhv_wireless_energy_hatch"
			id: "3B594BE1402C7B55"
			rewards: [{ id: "758A54F40ABB6F18", type: "xp", xp: 200 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "55A118F8F168C4C7", item: "gtceu:uhv_wireless_energy_hatch", type: "item" }
				{ id: "32CE1F0CEC423BA8", item: "gtceu:uhv_wireless_dynamo_hatch", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "The Network Goes UHV"
			x: 12.0d
			y: 41.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3B594BE1402C7B55"]
			description: ["The &6UHV Parallel Hatch&r runs a machine on 1,024 recipes at once. It is an assembly line recipe on a UHV hull with a UHV sensor and emitter, four UHV circuits, fibre laser modules, SRF cavities and mu-metal shields."]
			icon: "gtceu:uhv_parallel_hatch"
			id: "32E554E77D7298BA"
			rewards: [{ id: "7C3C911F3C4092B6", type: "xp", xp: 60 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "3B06AB8789839DB2", item: "gtceu:uhv_parallel_hatch", type: "item" }]
			title: "Parallel Hatch"
			x: 14.0d
			y: 41.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["105E4880E4ADC4FD"]
			description: ["The &6Quantum Fabricator&r does the work of the assembler, circuit assembler, forming press, laser engraver and cutter in one cleanroom machine. A parallel hatch multiplies it, and it overclocks perfectly. A cleanroom, UHV power, a parallel hatch and every older recipe's inputs on one bus. Your Assembly Hall folded into one machine. One bus of inputs, one of outputs: it takes the recipes of five machines."]
			icon: "gtceu:quantum_fabricator"
			id: "1A714B616F2F3010"
			rewards: [{ id: "57E37DFAF7195F0E", type: "xp", xp: 250 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "5B0B675A6B7F3B45", item: "gtceu:quantum_fabricator", type: "item" }]
			title: "Quantum Fabricator"
			x: 10.0d
			y: 43.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1338B882BFAB5DF8"]
			description: ["The seed for the Mercury bridge is made with the first swarm segment as the catalyst, and it needs no place. Once linked, the foundry's output reaches home through ME."]
			icon: "ae2:quantum_ring"
			id: "555DAA8FBE97E6F1"
			rewards: [{ id: "7FF1FBD3EC6380EA", type: "xp", xp: 100 }]
