		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5FD574B523467EFF"]
			description: ["The &6Fuel Fabrication Plant&r, the &6Hot Cell&r and the &6Pyroprocessing Cell&r take on the heavier isotopes: new fuels, new reprocessing, nothing new to build. Berkelium and californium from the reactor, and the hot cell's shielding. Driver elements, targets and the thorium line. Targets in by bus; spent elements back to the pyroprocessing cell."]
			icon: "gtceu:fuel_fabrication_plant"
