		{
			dependencies: ["5FD574B523467EFF"]
			description: ["Heavy water, platinum salts and rare-earth liquors from Proxima b go through the &6Platinum Plant&r, &6Heavy-Water Plant&r, &6Rare Earth Extraction Cascade&r, &6Regolith Cell&r and &6Lunar Solar Array&r. Each machine learns a new input. Proxima leach liquors, and the arrays tuned to the red. RTAN, UHV catalysts and the base's power. Liquors arrive over the Proxima AE2 pair; each plant hands its output on."]
			icon: "gtceu:heavy_water_plant"
