		{
			dependencies: ["5FD574B523467EFF"]
			description: ["The &6Ion Implanter&r, &6Isotope Column&r, &6MOCVD Reactor&r, &6Synchrotron&r, &6Antimatter Trap&r, &6Powder-in-Tube Line&r and &6Diamond Lattice Fab&r each take a new mode in UHV, for wafers and cells at the next purity. The UV versions of each, and the new isotopes. The next wafers and the antimatter route. Wafers and boules by bus; recycle what the column rejects."]
