		{
			dependencies: ["166C0A74107A1EF3"]
			description: [
				"Oganesson is the heaviest noble gas and the best propellant a thruster could ask for. The &6Oganesson Propellant Pod&r       packs it for the Dyson swarm, whose runs burn it. Oganesson from the cryogenic plant. The propellant the swarm burns. One pod line off the cryogenic plant, kept in its own tank."
				"Real oganesson lasts milliseconds and only a few atoms exist. GregTech Modern treats it as a stable gas, so here it is one."
			]
			icon: "grindless:oganesson_propellant_pod"
