		{
			dependencies: ["75B0EF109062BCC1"]
			description: ["The &6High Flux Reactor&r bombards curium in a dense neutron flux and is the start of every transcurium chain. Its controller, radiation-proof casing, light concrete, beryllium blocks and tungstensteel and PTFE pipe casing. One Terminal pass builds it. Berkelium and californium targets, and the driver elements that feed them. Targets and driver elements travel by ME; send spent drivers back to the reactor."]
