		}
		{
			dependencies: ["17FFD22B68F2339B"]
			description: ["The &6Transuranium Facility&r separates the irradiated targets into berkelium and californium. Its controller, radiation vault casing, radiation-proof casing, light concrete and PTFE pipe casing. One Terminal pass builds it. Berkelium-249 and the californium-252 source that cold-trap drilling and YBCO irradiation use as a catalyst. Keep the targets in sealed buses; leftovers go to the partitioning plant."]
			icon: "gtceu:transuranium_facility"
			id: "36C7A1B9DB6512D7"
