			title: "A Californium Source"
			x: 12.5d
			y: 14.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7365DAF24CBF4955"]
			description: [
				"Uranium-233 decays slowly into &6thorium-229&r, and the Transuranium Facility keeps the uranium in a decay store while the thorium grows in. It is rare, and its nucleus has the lowest excited state known."
				"The hot cell then dissolves it as a nitrate. Keep the store fed by ME and take the thorium out on a schedule."
			]
			icon: "grindless:thorium_229"
			id: "1CD9068EF0888D7B"
			rewards: [{ id: "3AE08C2CF2304B86", type: "xp", xp: 120 }]
			tasks: [
				{ id: "564E113400619266", item: "grindless:thorium_229", type: "item" }
				{ id: "7A34A3F67E73E637", item: "grindless:thorium_229_nitrate", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Thorium-229"
			x: 14.5d
			y: 14.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1CD9068EF0888D7B"]
			description: [
				"The nitrate is fluorinated in the fluorspar kiln to &6laser-grade thorium tetrafluoride&r, pure enough to dope a crystal. Then the crystal growth furnace grows it into calcium fluoride."
				"The Th:CaF2 crystal is what the Nuclear Clock Lab locks its laser onto. Automate it with the nitrate by ME and run the furnace on its own bus: a crystal takes hours."
			]
			icon: "grindless:thorium_caf2_crystal"
			id: "58C041A42E75C02F"
			rewards: [{ id: "5204151A403B25C1", type: "xp", xp: 120 }]
