		{
			dependencies: ["18F323E6ABB96566"]
			description: ["The same reactor that breeds californium breeds &6nickel-63&r: a nickel-62 target captures a neutron beside a driver element. It is a pure beta emitter, safe behind a thin shield, and the betavoltaic fab plates it from a liquor that is cleaned and reused."]
			icon: "grindless:nickel_63_target"
			id: "3E25FF12ADD0E625"
