		}
		{
			dependencies: ["75B0EF109062BCC1"]
			description: ["The &6Nuclear Clock Lab&r locks a laser onto a thorium-229 nucleus and keeps time to a part in a quintillion. Its controller, clean and robust machine casing, computer casing, laminated glass and a few radiation-proof casings. One Terminal pass builds it. The nuclear clock, the timing reference for the Mercury swarm and the gate. Thorium-229 targets come by ME; the clock leaves by ME."]
			icon: "gtceu:nuclear_clock_lab"
			id: "314A27EF247A656B"
