		{
			dependencies: ["314A27EF247A656B"]
			description: [
				"The &6Nuclear Clock&r is a thorium-229 target locked to a laser: it keeps time to a part in a quintillion, and every later machine that must agree on the second is timed from it."
				"It is made in the Nuclear Clock Lab from thorium-229 and a UHV circuit. It is a component of the gate and of the swarm control station, so build one early. Make them in the lab by ME and keep a small stock."
			]
			icon: "grindless:nuclear_clock"
