			dependencies: ["75B0EF109062BCC1"]
			description: ["The &6Betavoltaic Fab&r builds cells that turn the decay of nickel-63 straight into current, for decades. Its controller, inert machine casing, radiation vault casing, laminated glass and PTFE pipe casing. One Terminal pass builds it. Betavoltaic cells for sensors and probes that cannot be recharged. Nickel-63 targets by ME; cells leave by ME."]
