			dependencies: ["3F50627705B1E295"]
			description: [
				"A &6Betavoltaic Cell&r turns the beta decay of nickel-63 straight into current: microwatts for fifty years, with nothing to refuel."
				"The fab makes it from a nickel-63 target and clean-room parts. It powers sensors and probes that cannot be recharged, and the solar probe carries one. Automate it with a nickel-63 target feed from the driver line and a chest of finished cells."
