		{
			dependencies: ["5A330FB83CE86A66"]
			description: ["The &6Crystal Growth Furnace&r pulls lithium niobate and other boules out of a melt, slowly. Its controller, robust and heatproof casing, tritanium coils and tungstensteel pipe casing. One Terminal pass builds it. The lithium niobate wafer and the europium-doped boule behind optical memory. The wafer is etched into waveguides before any modulator is made. Feed seeds and melt by ME; a boule is hours of work, so run several furnaces."]
