		{
			dependencies: ["7A82260060D3ABC5"]
			description: ["The &6MBE Reactor&r lays a crystal down one atomic layer at a time in ultra-high vacuum. Its controller, UV machine casing, clean machine casing, frostproof casing and laminated glass. One Terminal pass builds it. The indium phosphide wafer and the quantum cascade laser built on it. Substrates and dopants by ME; keep the vacuum pump line free of byproducts."]
			icon: "gtceu:mbe_reactor"
