			description: ["The &6Photonic Foundry&r writes light paths and phase-change memory into a wafer. Its controller, clean and UV machine casing, filter casing and laminated glass. One Terminal pass builds it. The phase-change die and the optical assembly for photonic circuits. Wafers by ME from the furnaces; dies leave by ME."]
