		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5A330FB83CE86A66"]
			description: ["The &6Ultrapure Water Plant&r polishes water until it carries almost no ions at all. Its controller, clean, inert and filter casing and PTFE pipe casing. It takes grade 5 water, which five purification stages make from plain water. Ultrapure water at eighteen megohms, which the carbide fab, the solar array fab and every foundry recipe drink. Any ion left ruins a wafer. Build the five grades in order, then pipe the result straight to the fabs; do not bucket it."]
			icon: "gtceu:ultrapure_water_plant"
			id: "55CA018935CD3D42"
