		{
			dependencies: ["55CA018935CD3D42"]
			description: ["The &6SiC Device Fab&r grows and etches silicon carbide into power devices that run hot. Its controller, heatproof and robust machine casing, tritanium coils and tungstensteel pipe casing. One Terminal pass builds it. SiC power modules for the UHV power stage. The boule grows from source powder made of polysilicon, graphite and argon, so the silicon line feeds it. Powder, wafers and ultrapure water by pipe and ME; modules leave by ME."]
