		{
			dependencies: ["5A330FB83CE86A66"]
			description: ["The &6Organoid Array&r grows neural tissue on a scaffold under sterile flow. Its controller, plascrete, sterilizing filter casing, PTFE pipe casing, computer casing and cleanroom glass. One Terminal pass builds it. Neural organoids, the core of the wetware mainframe. The scaffold is chitosan, from the xenobiochemistry plant at Proxima b. Chitosan scaffolds and nutrient by ME and pipe; discard cultures on a schedule."]
