			description: ["The &6Tether Ribbon Works&r weaves fibre into a ribbon long enough to reach orbit. Its controller, robust and inert machine casing and tungstensteel gearboxes. One Terminal pass builds it. Tether ribbon segments for the space elevator. Fibre by ME; segments stack in a chest for the climber."]
			icon: "gtceu:tether_ribbon_works"
			id: "1618459D29E8311B"
