			x: 13.5d
			y: 36.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["12CE5149C7CF9F1B"]
			description: ["The &6Warp Gate&r is the first door to another star: a 15x15 ring of casings round open air, 25x9x20 in all, with a coil band and six UHV mounts for the modulators. Its controller, warp gate casing, field ring casing and the 48 superconducting coils of the wall band, with station truss, fusion glass and tungsten steel frames for the berm. It is built twice: once in Earth orbit and once in orbit of Proxima b. The gate seed and the trip to Proxima b. Power and cavity stacks by ME; only the seed leaves."]
			icon: "gtceu:warp_gate"
			id: "5BD78C42ED197713"
			rewards: [{ id: "3653FD146C8BBDC8", type: "xp", xp: 160 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
