			title: "Superconducting Wire"
			x: 13.5d
			y: 38.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["578E129AD9735B5E"]
			description: [
				"The &6Naquadria Magnet Works&r winds the cable into a gate coil. The winding is still not a superconductor."
