			dependencies: ["5A330FB83CE86A66"]
			description: ["The &6ZBLAN Draw Tower&r pulls fluoride glass in microgravity, where it does not crystallise. Its controller, clean and heatproof machine casing, station truss casing and tungstensteel pipe casing. One Terminal pass builds it. ZBLAN fibre, the lowest-loss optical fibre there is. Preforms by ME; the fibre spools out to a chest."]
