		{
			dependencies: ["36F23A4BE8B4232F"]
			description: [
				"&6ZBLAN Fibre&r is a fluoride glass drawn in microgravity, where it cannot crystallise, so it is the lowest-loss optical fibre there is."
				"The ZBLAN draw tower pulls it from a preform on the station. It is the light path of the photonic circuit stack and of the optical links of the ages after this. Automate it with preforms by ME and a chest on the spool."
