		{
			dependencies: ["1338B882BFAB5DF8"]
			description: ["The &6Regolith Excavator&r scrapes the surface of Mercury for dust and heat-baked rock. Its controller, Hermean heat shield bricks, heatproof casing and tungstensteel gearboxes. Mercury regolith for the vapour furnace. Dust leaves by ME; keep the bay cooled."]
