		{
			dependencies: ["78BB7429DEB0337C"]
			description: ["The &6Solar Vapour Furnace&r uses concentrated sunlight to boil regolith into its metals. Its controller, Hermean heat shield bricks, heliostat mirrors, night sky radiators and tungstensteel firebox casing. One Terminal pass builds it. Metals for swarm segments, free of fuel. Feed by ME; the heat is free but the mirrors need care."]
