		{
			dependencies: ["3613FBC056828C6E"]
			description: ["The &6Swarm Segment Foundry&r builds the panels of a star-powered swarm. Its controller, station truss casing, hangar casing, an assembly line unit with its grating, tungsten steel frames and a UHV hull. One Terminal pass builds it. Swarm segments, built from films, arrays, a laser, a spreader, a power module and cells. The whole swarm is one line, from Mercury regolith to the segment. Films, arrays and cells by ME; segments go to the control station and worn ones come back."]
			icon: "gtceu:swarm_segment_foundry"
			id: "52044A97A7656F49"
