		{
			dependencies: ["52044A97A7656F49"]
			description: [
				"A &6Swarm Segment&r is one mirror-and-collector panel of the thousands that make a star-powered swarm."
				"The foundry builds it from Mercury metals and a UHV hull. The control station needs a steady stream of them to steer the swarm and collect its power, which UEV asks for. Automate it with metals by ME and send segments straight to the station."
