		}
		{
			dependencies: ["52044A97A7656F49"]
			description: ["The &6Swarm Control Station&r steers the segments and collects their power. A very wide, low hall: its controller, a lot of station truss and pressure hull casing, laser module blocks, sapphire blocks, Hermean heat shield bricks and a UHV hull. One Terminal pass builds it. Stellar power for UHV and the coronal map. Segments by ME; the station needs a steady stream."]
			icon: "gtceu:swarm_control_station"
