		{
			dependencies: ["581801EBC014A606"]
			description: ["The &6Solar Probe Bay&r launches probes into the corona to map its field. Its controller, station truss casing, superconducting coils and laminated glass. The coronal field map for the Kardashev goal. Probes by ME; maps leave by ME."]
