		{
			dependencies: ["3B842B6DA3F17B57"]
			description: [
				"A &6Sample Canister&r holds rock and soil from another world and is the proof that the trip worked. It is opened only in a sealed lab."
				"The sample receiving facility opens it behind BSL-4 walls and sorts what it holds. Those samples feed the surface machines on Proxima b and the life rows of UEV. Automate it with canisters by ME and keep nothing unsterilised outside the lab."
