			description: ["The &6Xenobiochem Plant&r refines alien biomass into pigments and radioprotectants. Its controller, sealed-lab walls, PTFE pipe casing and clean machine casing. One Terminal pass builds it. Chitin from the mushrooms, then chitosan and the freeze-cast scaffold that carries organoids, mixed with melanin into the flare shield. Also radioprotectant and the far-red algae. It is portable processing, so it works on any base. Biomass by ME; pipe the chitosan on and send scaffolds home."]
