		{
			dependencies: ["196AF7B23C8B0529"]
			description: ["The &6Implanted LN Wafer&r: Lithium niobate with a buried layer of helium bubbles, ready to split. Made in the &6Ion Implantation&r from the Lithium Niobate Wafer, with helium, in the cleanroom. Made by the ion implanter (circuit 3); bonded and split in the photonic foundry (circuit 1). The LNOI Wafer and Lithium Niobate Wafer in the Photonic Foundry. A pattern provider on the machine of the step before keeps it supplied."]
			icon: "grindless:implanted_ln_wafer"
			id: "1D881E22B1700D17"
