			title: "Superlattice Wafer"
			x: 15.0d
			y: 61.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["196AF7B23C8B0529"]
			description: ["The &6SiC Wafer&r: A polished silicon carbide wafer, hard enough to need a diamond wire. Made in the &6Cutter&r from the SiC Boule, with lubricant, in the cleanroom. Cut from a SiC boule; the SiC device fab grows its epi layer (circuit 2). The Hpsi SiC Wafer and SiC Epi Wafer in the Chemical Vapour Infiltration. Chain the machines by ME, and keep a small buffer of this wafer between steps."]
			icon: "grindless:sic_wafer"
			id: "742D9701FE0409BB"
			rewards: [{ id: "136D57FF6C6C1D4F", type: "xp", xp: 50 }]
