			title: "SiC Wafer"
			x: 15.0d
			y: 63.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["742D9701FE0409BB"]
			description: ["The &6Epi Wafer&r: A silicon carbide wafer with a grown drift layer. Made in the &6Silicon Carbide Devices&r from the SiC Wafer, with silane, in the cleanroom. Made by the SiC device fab; implanted with aluminium in the ion implanter (circuit 4). The Implanted SiC Wafer in the Ion Implantation. Stock it by ME and let the next step pull it; nothing here needs a hand."]
			icon: "grindless:sic_epi_wafer"
			id: "7CB7C602E755D85A"
