		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7CB7C602E755D85A"]
			description: ["The &6Implanted Wafer&r: Aluminium ions in a silicon carbide epi layer, waiting for the 1,700 °C anneal. Made in the &6Ion Implantation&r from the Epi Wafer and Aluminium, in the cleanroom. Made by the ion implanter (circuit 4); annealed into device wafers in the SiC device fab. The SiC Device Wafer in the Silicon Carbide Devices. Stock it by ME and let the next step pull it; nothing here needs a hand."]
			icon: "grindless:implanted_sic_wafer"
