		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3FB3004B9B41D001"]
			description: ["The &6Device Wafer&r: Annealed silicon carbide transistors, still on the wafer. Made in the &6Silicon Carbide Devices&r from the Implanted Wafer and Graphite, in the cleanroom. Made by the SiC device fab (circuit 3); diced into four power modules (circuit 4). The SiC Power Module in the Silicon Carbide Devices. Stock it by ME and let the next step pull it; nothing here needs a hand."]
			icon: "grindless:sic_device_wafer"
