		{
			dependencies: ["196AF7B23C8B0529"]
			description: ["The &6IMM Epi Wafer&r: GaInP, GaAs and InGaAs junctions grown upside down on a gallium arsenide wafer. Made by the first machine of its line; the cleanroom and EMI show the exact recipe. Made by the MOCVD reactor (circuit 7); lifted off in the solar array fab (circuit 1). The Gallium Arsenide Wafer and Gallium Arsenide in the Space Photovoltaics. Stock it by ME and let the next step pull it; nothing here needs a hand."]
