			dependencies: ["196AF7B23C8B0529"]
			description: ["The &6Dyson System Controller&r runs the Dyson swarm that collects a star's light into power. The controller takes darmstadtium plates, UHV circuits and an atomic casing. Dyson swarm recipes and the power they return. Item buses in feed the swarm; the power leaves through its own hatch."]
