		{
			dependencies: ["196AF7B23C8B0529"]
			description: ["The &6Web Hub&r is the centre of a wireless energy web: every receiver of the web draws from it. The controller takes a Web Receiver, neutronium plates and a UV sensor. Wireless energy to every receiver in the web. It takes no items: link it to the power source and its receivers."]
